  "releaseNotes": "* Added ``Version`` methods ``Max`` and ``Min`` C#14 static extension methods.\n* Deprecated ``Version`` methods ``GetNewerVersion`` and ``GetOlderVersion`` for removal in v10 - Use the newly added ``Max`` and ``Min`` C#14 static extension methods instead.\n* Added ``Directory`` static C# extension methods for Safe File Enumeration and Safe Directory Enumeration\n* Fixed issues with .NET Standard 2.0 fallback for Safe File Enumeration & Getting that would return empty sequences and arrays respectively - .NET 8+ method is unaffected. Backported to 9.2.x branch.\n* Fixed issues with .NET Standard 2.0 fallback for Safe Directory Enumeration_ & Getting that would return empty sequences and arrays respectively - .NET 8+ method is unaffected. Backported to 9.2.x branch.",
